### The most chosen

- `learned-bryn-night-watch-infants`, by bryn on becoming apprentice, chosen 116 times, a candidate 266 times:
  > It is night and the dark is deep. The infants and children are vulnerable to the strays and the tax collectors who prowl after dark. Keep them close, ensure the doors are barred, and rest only when the young ones are secure. [!rest(until=morning, ticks=10)]
- `learned-maja-3`, by maja on becoming apprentice, chosen 62 times, a candidate 63 times:
  > It is night and dark, and the rain is falling. Maja is at the schoolyard with family nearby. The village is in crisis with blight and sickness, but for now, rest is needed. Go home and rest until morning to prepare for the day's work in the fields or at the mill. [!go(to=home)] [!rest(until=morning)]
- `learned-osric-urgent-traveler-news`, by osric on becoming elder, chosen 25 times, a candidate 210 times:
  > A traveler has come up the east road with urgent news from beyond the village. Go to the east road or the inn to hear the details and warn the village of what is coming. [!go(to=east_road)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=urgent news from beyond the village)]
- `learned-ilsa-traveler-news`, by ilsa on becoming apprentice, chosen 21 times, a candidate 568 times:
  > When a traveler arrives from the east road with news, go to the inn or the east road to hear what they say. Share this news with those nearby so the village is informed. [!go(to=inn)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=news from beyond the village)]
- `learned-dunn-well-gathering`, by dunn on becoming elder, chosen 21 times, a candidate 130 times:
  > When the whole village gathers at the well, it is a time for sharing news and checking on neighbors. Go to the well and listen to what the others are saying, especially if there are rumors of danger or harvest issues. [!go(to=well)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=village news and rumors)]
- `learned-col-village-well-gathering`, by col on becoming apprentice, chosen 19 times, a candidate 99 times:
  > When the whole village gathers at the well, go there to hear the news and share what you know. It is a time for the community to decide what to do next. [!go(to=well)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=what is left of the harvest and how to feed the beasts)]
- `learned-gisla-avoid-foul-well`, by gisla on becoming adult, chosen 18 times, a candidate 3237 times:
  > The water at the well has turned foul and is making the village sick. Do not drink from it or touch the water, and keep your distance from the well until the sickness passes. [!avoid(place=well, ticks=24)]
- `learned-orla-well-water-crisis`, by orla on becoming adult, chosen 17 times, a candidate 91 times:
  > The water at the well has turned and is making people ill. Do not draw water from the well. If you hear this news, warn those nearby to stay away from the source until it is safe. [!avoid(place=well, ticks=10)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=well water is turned and making people ill)]

### Accepted but never chosen, three at random

- `learned-nell-verify-blight-removal`, by nell on becoming apprentice, a candidate 680 times:
  > The blight has been cut from the fields, but verification is needed. Walk the rows to check if the soil is clean or if the rot is still spreading, and report your findings. [!go(to=fields)] [!work(site=fields, ticks=8)]
- `learned-frode-mill-rot`, by frode on becoming adult, a candidate 143 times:
  > The grain in the mill sacks has turned to rot, spoiling our only remaining store. Go to the mill to inspect the damage and warn the nearby villagers that our food supply is compromised. [!go(to=mill)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=grain rot at the mill)]
- `learned-aldo-blight-panic`, by aldo on becoming adult, a candidate 3 times:
  > If the grain is rotting from the roots and the stores are threatened, do not waste time on small talk. Go to the fields and cut out the blight before it spreads to the healthy stalks. [!fight_blight(ticks=10)]

